1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:15,250
What did the man in this story do?
这个故事里的人做了什么？

2
00:00:15,250 --> 00:00:18,380
What did the man in this story do?
这个故事里的人做了什么？

3
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:24,850
When a plane from London arrived at Sydney airport,
当一架从伦敦飞来的飞机抵达悉尼机场时，

4
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:31,350
workers began to unload a number of wooden boxes which contained clothing.
工人们开始卸下大批装着衣服的木箱子。

5
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:39,610
No one could account for the fact that one of the boxes was extremely heavy.
其中一个箱子特别重，谁也解释不清其中的原因。

6
00:00:41,510 --> 00:00:45,900
It suddenly occurred to one of the workers to open up the box.
一个工人突然想到打开箱子看看。

7
00:00:46,550 --> 00:00:49,760
He was astonished at what he found.
看到里面的东西他大吃一惊。

8
00:00:50,380 --> 00:00:55,330
A man was lying in the box on top of a pile of woollen goods.
一个人正躺在箱子里的一堆毛织品上面。

9
00:00:56,850 --> 00:00:59,700
He was so surprised at being discovered
被人发现使他非常吃惊，

10
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:02,840
that he did not even try to run away.
他甚至没有试图逃跑。

11
00:01:04,320 --> 00:01:06,130
After he was arrested,
被捕以后，

12
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:11,350
the man admitted hiding in the box before the plane left London.
这个人承认在飞机离开伦敦前就藏进了箱子。

13
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:15,590
He had had a long and uncomfortable trip,
他经历了一次漫长而难受的旅行，

14
00:01:16,660 --> 00:01:21,450
for he had been confined to the wooden box for over eighteen hours.
因为他在木箱里被关了十八个多小时。

15
00:01:22,850 --> 00:01:28,980
The man was ordered to pay ￡3, 500 for
这个人被责令支付3,500英镑，

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:30,080
the cost of the trip.
作为这次旅行的费用。

17
00:01:30,960 --> 00:01:34,690
The normal price of a ticket is ￡2, 000!
而一张机票的正常价格是2,000英镑！
